  'Model – “My Leaf Butterfly”: I collected dry leaves, twigs, an old greeting card and two straws. I pasted the leaves on the card as the wings of a butterfly. I used a twig for its body and cut the straws for its antennae. I coloured the background with sketch pens. My leaf butterfly looks colourful, natural and eco-friendly.',
